Application-aware routing plugin for OPNsense.

Routes traffic from specific LAN clients through designated gateways
based on application categories (e.g., Chinese video, social media,
shopping) or destination networks (e.g., all mainland China IPs).
Domains are turned into IPs by sniffing the DNS answers the firewall
sends to clients; learned IPs expire when no longer handed out.

WWW: https://github.com/DaneHou/os-app-router
